name: Erratic 10/4 Walkie Talkie — many Tens and Fours
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with both Ten and Four density for Walkie Talkie, which gives
  +10 Chips and +4 Mult when played 10s or 4s score. RAG aliases: rank 10 4, WalkieTalkie,
  walkie talkie seed, many tens and fours, erratic 10s 4s.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Ten
    min: 8
  - erraticRank: Four
    min: 8
  - joker: WalkieTalkie
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Hack
    label: "Retriggers played 4s for extra Walkie Talkie scoring"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: EvenSteven
    label: "10s and 4s are both even-rank played-card payoffs"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: TheTrio
    label: "Rank density supports Three of a Kind lines"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Rank density supports Four/Five of a Kind lines"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
